===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|pénkʷe}}
[[penta-|pent(a)-]] + [[polyomino|(poly)omino]]

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|es}}

# {{lb|en|geometry}} A [[polyomino]] made up of five square units. When packing pentominoes into [[three-dimensional]] shapes, the square units commonly are expanded into cubes instead of being flattened.

